        {
          "text": " Haryabaho obumanyiso aha izooba n'aha kwezi n'aha nyonyoozi, kandi aha nsi amahanga garyashaasha, gashobeirwe ahabw'okuhoorera kw'enyanja n'ebingonzi; ",
